WEBVTT

00:55.063 --> 00:59.898
Episode 1
A Reunion

01:02.037 --> 01:05.438
Kongouhou Temple
Kouya Mountain, Wakayama

01:21.356 --> 01:23.347
You're putting in
quite an effort there.

01:24.459 --> 01:26.154
Oh, it's you, Gramps.

01:26.261 --> 01:29.162
Doing such hard labor
at such an hour.

01:29.264 --> 01:32.062
I like physical activities...

01:32.167 --> 01:34.032
...so it's really fun.

01:34.136 --> 01:35.433
That is good.

01:36.938 --> 01:39.964
Everyone was making
a riot about someone...

01:40.075 --> 01:44.068
...sneaking in and eating the rice
from the tub before dinner.

01:44.179 --> 01:46.340
It looks like punishment for that.

01:46.448 --> 01:48.882
What, you knew about it,
and came to mock me...

01:50.452 --> 01:52.181
I'm still in my growth spurt!

01:52.287 --> 01:54.721
I can't possibly last until dinner!

01:54.823 --> 01:55.721
I can't help it!

01:57.025 --> 01:59.926
This place will be rather quiet
with you gone.

02:01.963 --> 02:03.260
What did you just say?

02:04.332 --> 02:07.790
This place will be rather quiet
with you gone.

02:07.903 --> 02:09.461
Gramps, that means...

02:10.672 --> 02:12.230
The stars have shifted.

02:13.308 --> 02:14.206
The stars?

02:15.410 --> 02:18.846
A star that shines brighter
than all the others has shifted.

02:24.586 --> 02:26.076
I see...

02:26.188 --> 02:27.883
So it's finally beginning...

02:29.491 --> 02:32.051
You must be on your way...

02:32.160 --> 02:36.859
...as a Dragon of Heaven,
one of the Seven Seals.

02:36.965 --> 02:39.331
That is your destiny.

02:39.434 --> 02:41.368
Gramps Stargazer, I...

02:42.771 --> 02:44.295
I understand.

02:44.406 --> 02:45.805
Don't say anything.

02:47.976 --> 02:49.534
All right.

02:49.644 --> 02:51.009
But instead of that, I...

02:52.948 --> 02:57.146
I'll polish this place so well that
you can see your face in it.

02:59.621 --> 03:02.988
Ise Shrine, Mie

03:18.406 --> 03:19.373
I understand.

03:21.309 --> 03:23.334
And what did Lady Hinoto say?

03:23.445 --> 03:26.243
To gather in Tokyo
as soon as possible.

03:26.348 --> 03:27.246
I see...

03:28.350 --> 03:30.375
So the day has finally...

03:30.485 --> 03:32.112
Lady Kaede...

03:32.220 --> 03:34.916
Thank you for taking care
of me for so long.

03:36.024 --> 03:37.355
I should thank you.

03:37.459 --> 03:40.087
I really am glad that I met you.

03:42.998 --> 03:43.896
Arashi.

03:46.434 --> 03:51.064
I'll comb this fine hair of yours
for the first time in a while tonight.

03:55.877 --> 03:59.278
Mitsumine Shrine, Chichibu

04:20.068 --> 04:21.467
What's wrong, Inuki?

04:31.379 --> 04:32.403
Inuki?

04:41.456 --> 04:44.118
Grandma,
Inuki is acting funny.

04:44.226 --> 04:45.818
That's right.

04:45.927 --> 04:47.554
Inuki is wise.

04:47.662 --> 04:49.357
He knows.

04:50.632 --> 04:51.496
Knows what?

04:53.535 --> 04:58.131
That the time your powers
are needed has come.

04:58.240 --> 05:00.401
The time our powers are needed?

05:02.510 --> 05:04.000
T-That means...

05:07.916 --> 05:09.713
I can go to Tokyo!

05:09.818 --> 05:10.716
All right!

05:10.819 --> 05:12.844
Inuki, when I go to Tokyo...

05:12.954 --> 05:15.354
...I want to eat ice cream
at the Petit Rondo, and...

05:15.457 --> 05:16.651
Now, Yuzuriha!

05:18.026 --> 05:19.391
I know.

05:19.494 --> 05:20.392
Right, Inuki?

05:22.464 --> 05:24.159
Arashiyama, Kyoto

05:24.266 --> 05:25.733
I've just finished the case...

05:25.834 --> 05:26.801
Sumeragi

05:26.902 --> 05:29.496
...for the Imperial Household Office.
- Is that so?

05:29.604 --> 05:31.731
Thank you for all the hard work.

05:33.642 --> 05:36.907
Have you been
doing well, Subaru?

05:37.012 --> 05:37.876
Yes.

05:37.979 --> 05:42.678
Please visit the Kyoto area
once every so often as well.

05:42.784 --> 05:47.016
I'll come visit for my sister's
seventh year ritual next month.

05:47.122 --> 05:48.714
Is that so?

05:48.823 --> 05:50.188
I see.

05:50.292 --> 05:53.318
We will be eagerly
awaiting you, Subaru.

05:53.428 --> 05:55.589
All right.
Then if you'll excuse me.

06:14.249 --> 06:15.648
Inverted pentagram?

06:15.750 --> 06:17.684
The symbol of the Sakurazukamori.

06:27.062 --> 06:28.461
Sister...

06:28.563 --> 06:31.088
I think I can finally
meet him again.

06:32.200 --> 06:33.861
Will you be happy for me?

06:33.969 --> 06:34.833
Or...

06:36.871 --> 06:39.362
Kabukicho, Shinjuku

06:41.376 --> 06:45.005
FLOWER
Aesthetician-style

06:46.314 --> 06:47.872
Miss Karen,
you've been called for.

06:49.017 --> 06:50.575
All right, I'll be right over.

07:22.484 --> 07:25.385
It looks like
my real calling has arrived.

07:27.589 --> 07:31.389
A publishing house in Tokyo

07:32.560 --> 07:33.925
Chief!

07:34.029 --> 07:37.294
Mr. Maruyama's manuscripts
barely made it for publication.

07:37.399 --> 07:39.094
I'm glad. That's a relief.

07:39.200 --> 07:41.896
Yes, really.
It was touch and go...

07:42.003 --> 07:43.527
Thanks for your hard work.

07:43.638 --> 07:45.196
Oh? That's nice.

07:46.574 --> 07:47.438
Oh, this?

07:48.543 --> 07:51.034
It's a birthday gift from my wife.

07:51.146 --> 07:54.946
Of course, I'm sure my daughter,
Yuka, picked the design.

07:55.050 --> 07:57.575
It looks great on you, Mr. Aoki.
It really does.

07:57.685 --> 07:58.549
Well, thank you.

08:00.121 --> 08:01.088
And now...

08:19.307 --> 08:21.434
I'll do the work tomorrow.

08:21.543 --> 08:25.001
I should continue reading
the picture book to Yuka tonight.

08:30.919 --> 08:33.149
The Dragons of Heaven...

08:33.254 --> 08:35.279
...are gathering here in Tokyo.

08:39.160 --> 08:40.422
The Seven Seals...

08:41.529 --> 08:43.520
The seven stars of heaven...

08:44.799 --> 08:51.102
And the one that emits a light
stronger than all the others...

08:55.243 --> 08:56.141
"Kamui."

08:58.379 --> 09:01.246
Everything has
now started to move.

09:19.167 --> 09:23.729
Togakushi Shrine

09:49.297 --> 09:50.321
It's you, Kamui?

09:52.367 --> 09:54.426
I'm here to pick up
the Divine Sword.

09:57.539 --> 09:59.666
It's been six years now...

10:01.409 --> 10:04.936
Your mother, Tohru,
entrusted me with this...

10:05.046 --> 10:06.877
...and I have been
protecting it since.

10:07.982 --> 10:11.281
It's true that this is
something you should have...

10:11.386 --> 10:13.786
...but I cannot give
it to you right away.

10:17.358 --> 10:18.620
Why is that?

10:18.726 --> 10:20.921
I must see through it...

10:21.029 --> 10:25.159
...whether or not you're worthy
of wielding this Divine Sword.

10:25.266 --> 10:26.528
See through it?

10:26.634 --> 10:27.532
Who?

10:27.635 --> 10:29.125
For what?

10:29.237 --> 10:30.795
You will understand in time.

10:31.906 --> 10:34.841
Saying that on a whim
is problematic.

10:34.943 --> 10:38.811
I was planning to take that
and leave Tokyo immediately.

10:38.913 --> 10:39.811
You cannot.

10:42.050 --> 10:42.914
I'm at a loss.

10:44.152 --> 10:46.211
I don't want to be
treated like a kid.

10:46.321 --> 10:48.551
I don't intend
to follow anyone's orders.

10:51.159 --> 10:52.990
Hurry up and hand it over.

10:58.199 --> 10:59.860
If you want it that badly...

11:03.338 --> 11:07.206
...defeat me
and take it away from me.

11:07.308 --> 11:08.935
Are you serious?

11:09.043 --> 11:10.601
Do you really
mean to fight me?

11:12.447 --> 11:14.039
I have no other choice.

11:14.148 --> 11:15.638
I'll tell you now...

11:15.750 --> 11:17.308
I won't hold anything back.

11:27.929 --> 11:30.022
You really want me
to kill you that much?

11:47.315 --> 11:50.614
This Song of Eternal Parting
was written by Kenji...

11:50.718 --> 11:53.482
...upon the death
of his younger sister Toshi.

11:53.588 --> 11:59.220
The portion,
"oraoradeshitoriegumo"...

11:59.327 --> 12:05.698
...is supposedly the words
Toshi uttered from her sickbed...

12:05.800 --> 12:07.358
...and can be interpreted...
- Oh, sorry.

12:07.468 --> 12:08.400
...as showing Toshi's feelings...

12:08.503 --> 12:09.731
- Here.
- Thank you.

12:09.837 --> 12:11.134
Monou!

12:11.239 --> 12:15.107
Read from the sixth line
on page 43.

12:15.209 --> 12:16.198
A-All right.

12:17.312 --> 12:20.110
"I pray from
the bottom of my heart...

12:20.214 --> 12:22.978
...as you eat these
two bowls of snow."

12:23.084 --> 12:26.315
"That this will become
heavenly ice cream...

12:26.421 --> 12:30.152
...and will become sacred food
for you and everyone else."

12:30.258 --> 12:32.954
"I hope,
humbly praying on my knees."

12:53.948 --> 12:55.779
Kamui?

12:58.453 --> 13:00.478
Hey, Kotori,
aren't you done yet?

13:00.588 --> 13:01.486
You'll be late!

13:03.091 --> 13:03.989
All right.

13:10.365 --> 13:13.459
Father, can you take
the laundry in when it's dry?

13:13.568 --> 13:15.536
Yeah, I know.

13:15.636 --> 13:16.660
We're going now!

13:24.212 --> 13:26.874
I had a dream last night.

13:26.981 --> 13:28.073
A dream?

13:28.182 --> 13:30.013
A dream again of...

13:30.118 --> 13:31.050
Don't worry.

13:31.152 --> 13:33.382
It was a good dream last night.

13:33.488 --> 13:34.750
I see.

13:34.856 --> 13:38.383
You remember Kamui,
who lived near us before?

13:38.493 --> 13:41.326
I had a dream that Kamui
was coming back.

13:41.429 --> 13:43.795
I see, Kamui...

13:43.898 --> 13:45.331
That brings back memories...

13:45.433 --> 13:47.594
The three of us
used to play together a lot.

13:47.702 --> 13:51.160
Yeah... I wonder
what he's doing now.

13:51.272 --> 13:54.002
Maybe he's turned into
a complete bookworm.

13:55.143 --> 13:56.405
That's possible.

14:13.194 --> 14:15.424
That's enough, all of you.

14:16.531 --> 14:19.364
Making me late the first day
I transfer into a school?

14:20.802 --> 14:22.497
Well, it doesn't matter at all.

14:40.054 --> 14:41.112
You're annoying...

14:41.222 --> 14:42.450
Nothing but eyesores!

14:42.557 --> 14:43.455
Get lost!

15:04.312 --> 15:05.836
Paper Spell Servants...

15:05.947 --> 15:09.974
They think too little of me
if spell servants were my opponents.

15:12.220 --> 15:15.383
Go back and tell your master...

15:15.490 --> 15:18.357
If you're going to get in my way,
come prepared to die.

15:22.129 --> 15:25.223
This Song of Eternal Parting
was written by Kenji...

15:25.333 --> 15:28.302
...upon the death
of his younger sister Toshi.

15:28.402 --> 15:34.102
The portion,
"oraoradeshitoriegumo"...

15:34.208 --> 15:36.904
...is supposedly the words
Toshi uttered from her sickbed...

15:37.011 --> 15:38.603
...and can be interpreted...
- Oh, sorry.

15:38.713 --> 15:39.737
...as showing Toshi's feelings...

15:39.847 --> 15:41.075
- Huh?
- What?

15:42.316 --> 15:43.681
- Here.
- Thank you.

15:43.784 --> 15:45.081
Monou!

15:45.186 --> 15:49.054
Read from the sixth line
on page 43.

15:49.156 --> 15:50.054
A-All right.

15:51.158 --> 15:53.956
"I pray from
the bottom of my heart...

15:54.061 --> 15:56.825
...as you eat these
two bowls of snow."

15:56.931 --> 16:00.162
"That this will become
heavenly ice cream...

16:00.268 --> 16:04.261
...and will become sacred food
for you and everyone else."

16:04.372 --> 16:05.964
Something's strange...

16:06.073 --> 16:07.005
This is...

16:17.752 --> 16:18.650
No way!

16:22.123 --> 16:23.647
Monou, what's wrong?

16:23.758 --> 16:24.816
You can sit down now!

16:26.894 --> 16:27.792
A-All right.

16:38.673 --> 16:39.867
Hey, goalkeeper!

16:43.010 --> 16:44.238
Oh, shoot...

16:44.345 --> 16:47.109
Man, you did it again, Monou.

16:47.214 --> 16:48.977
I thought I was gonna die...

16:49.083 --> 16:50.948
Sorry, I'll go get the ball.

17:18.512 --> 17:20.104
That can't be.

17:20.214 --> 17:22.045
Monou, the ball!

17:22.149 --> 17:23.582
Oh, sorry, sorry!

17:37.064 --> 17:38.156
Oh, Kotori!

17:38.265 --> 17:39.823
I got news!

17:39.934 --> 17:44.564
The boy who transferred to our class
today's really handsome!

17:44.672 --> 17:45.661
Oh, I see.

17:46.941 --> 17:49.705
And he's kinda cool.
We don't see that often.

17:49.810 --> 17:50.708
There he is!

17:52.947 --> 17:54.574
That boy, that boy!

17:54.682 --> 17:57.242
See? He's a little short...

17:58.352 --> 18:00.149
But he's fine!

18:00.254 --> 18:01.585
Wait!

18:01.689 --> 18:03.020
Kotori?

18:03.124 --> 18:06.116
- Oh my...
- She's so aggressive.

18:06.227 --> 18:07.455
What happened to her?

18:11.198 --> 18:12.096
Wait!

18:13.501 --> 18:15.025
Please, wait just a minute!

18:27.782 --> 18:29.613
Um, well... Can it be...

18:31.185 --> 18:33.153
...that you're Kamui?

18:34.288 --> 18:35.186
You are, right?

18:36.524 --> 18:39.459
I'm Kotori
from the Togakushi Shrine.

18:39.560 --> 18:40.424
Kotori Monou.

18:43.831 --> 18:45.696
It really is you!

18:45.800 --> 18:48.200
It's been a while, Kamui Shirou.

18:49.437 --> 18:51.405
I was surprised...

18:51.505 --> 18:54.269
...because my dream
last night came true.

18:54.375 --> 18:57.572
I had a dream that you'd transferred
to our school, Kamui.

18:59.346 --> 19:00.506
What's wrong?

19:00.614 --> 19:01.672
Something's strange.

19:02.817 --> 19:04.751
Oh, I know.

19:04.852 --> 19:07.218
You're tense because
you just transferred here.

19:07.321 --> 19:08.219
Am I right?

19:09.690 --> 19:11.385
Don't involve yourself with me.

19:13.494 --> 19:15.689
Don't talk to me ever again.

19:19.066 --> 19:22.934
I don't know what's going on,
but you're being rather rude.

19:23.037 --> 19:25.801
It's the first time
I've seen you in a while, too...

19:25.906 --> 19:27.999
I'm not who I was
six years ago.

19:28.109 --> 19:29.371
What does that mean?

19:29.477 --> 19:30.569
Don't involve yourself with me.

19:32.880 --> 19:34.814
I see...

19:35.015 --> 19:35.913
All right.

19:37.284 --> 19:39.184
I'm sorry I was so friendly then.

19:52.366 --> 19:53.765
What was that?

19:53.868 --> 19:54.766
He's strange!

20:02.042 --> 20:04.272
How long do you plan
on eavesdropping?

20:15.189 --> 20:16.349
Princess Hinoto!

20:16.457 --> 20:17.355
Princess!

20:21.328 --> 20:22.852
I thought I said...

20:22.963 --> 20:25.431
...if you get in my way,
come prepared to die.

20:25.533 --> 20:27.558
Sneaking around like that...

20:27.668 --> 20:30.398
I hate anything
and everything about it.

20:30.504 --> 20:31.698
Princess...

20:31.806 --> 20:33.330
It's nothing serious.

20:33.440 --> 20:36.500
It's just that my vision
spell was reflected back.

20:36.610 --> 20:38.908
Impossible.
Your spell, Princess?

20:40.881 --> 20:44.373
I had a good look...
at his face.

20:47.388 --> 20:52.655
That was the face of the boy
who appeared in my dream.

20:55.129 --> 20:57.927
So... that is "Kamui."
